  "DescIdentified": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "Crafted for the Lord of Lothlorien, these silks offer a sanctuary of stillness against the chaos of the world. The weave turns away the prying thoughts of enemies, ensuring a mind remains as clear as the forest air."
    }
